{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmfidZGXGsVoMWu7EdsN","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I'm not done yet. If I had to pick now, I'd lean towards מיטב's \"עוקב מדדי מניות\". It showed the biggest numbers I saw, \"25.86%\" for 3 years and \"17.25%\" for 5. The fee is 0.65%, which sounds like nothing, and I've heard of מיטב. I'm not sure, and I wouldn't open anything today based on this. I gave up around screen 9 of 15 because it's just too long.\n\n**What I looked at, in order**\n- **Top of the page:** the heading \"כל המסלולים בכל החברות\" and that \"קופת גמל להשקעה\" was already picked. Then \"143 מסלולים של 12 חברות\". 143 put me off straight away.\n- **The filter buttons:** there's one for \"עוקב מדד s&p 500 12\". That's probably the button for me, but the list I scrolled was still all 143 tracks.\n- **The table:** I only read the track name, the fee \"מהחיסכון\" and the big return numbers.\n    - The first group's S&P track, 13414, is 0.56% with 13.7% for 3 years. But I never saw which company that group is.\n    - מור is in there, but its fees are higher, around 0.7%.\n    - אנליסט has \"עוקב מדדים - גמיש\" with 26.39% for 3 years. That's the biggest number I saw.\n    - מיטב is 0.58–0.67%, and that's where its \"עוקב מדדי מניות\" is.\n    - אלטשולר שחם has the cheapest S&P I saw, at 0.54%. That's a name I know from ads. But instead of a return it just says \"פחות מ־3 שנים\", so I can't judge it.\n- **I stopped at ילין לפידות**, around screen 9.\n\n**What I skipped**\n- The orange warning box.\n- The small text under the heading.\n- The \"קופה\" numbers.\n- The fee \"מההפקדות\" (I assumed it's basically 0).\n- The little circles with מניות/מט\"ח.\n- How big each fund is (the \"מיליון/מיליארד\" column).\n- Screens 10–15 I never looked at.\n\n**What I didn't get**\n- \"מט\"ח\". Next to \"99%\" I've no idea what that means.\n- \"גמיש\", \"הלכה\", \"כספי (שקלי)\".\n- \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" where a return should be.\n- Whether \"3 שנים 24.04%\" is per year or the total for 3 years.\n- Why \"מניות\" tracks show more than the S&P ones. Isn't S&P stocks too?\n\n**What bothered me**\n- **I couldn't always tell which company a row belonged to.** The name only shows once, on a separate line above each group's rows. When I scrolled, sometimes that line was hidden under the table header that stays at the top. So I got numbers without a company, like the first group and the group on screen 8.\n- **It's way too long to compare by scrolling.** Every company has a \"מניות\" and a \"כללי\" and an S&P, so they all look the same after a while.\n- **Some cheap tracks have no return at all,** just \"פחות מ־3 שנים\" or \"עוד לא דווח\". So the cheapest one (אלטשולר's S&P) is the one I can't judge.\n- **It doesn't say what to choose.** There's no recommendation, so I'd rather do nothing today."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1880,"cache_read_input_tokens":19305,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1880},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7d55d44f-e3f9-4bbf-9676-4a6fe12a4131","uuid":"f59e8fb3-116a-4356-abe9-40844b776d46","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:24:04.633Z","request_id":"req_011CgmfidJ8gi32DfcCRU7h7"}
